{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38595","headline":"赠方干处士歌 · 吴融","name":"赠方干处士歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"把笔尽爲诗，何人敌夫子。\n句满天下口，名聒天下耳。\n不识朝，不识市。\n旷逍遥，闲徙倚。\n一桮酒，无万事。\n一叶舟，无千里。\n衣裳白云，坐卧流水。\n霜落风高忽相忆，惠然见过留一夕。\n一夕听吟十数篇，水榭林萝爲岑寂。\n拂旦舍我亦不辞，携筇径去随所适。\n随所适，无处觅。\n云半片，鹤一只。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴融","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38595.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38595","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}